<title>FRANCE: CGIP in early redemption of convertible.</title>
<headline>CGIP in early redemption of convertible.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>CGIP said it was going to pay back its 3.75 percent January 1995 to January 2004 convertible bond from May 26 at a price of 1,438.06 francs per bond with 20.11 francs in a missed interest compensation.</p>
<p>It said the convertibility would be maintained for three months until August 26 on the basis of one share for one bond.</p>
<p>CGIP shares closed at 1,772 francs on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
